                    Start before <strong style="color:#3f3f46">2026-07-01T00:00:00Z</strong>. After that the invitation stops working. If you did not expect this email, you can safely ignore it.
                  </p>
              
            </td>
          </tr>
          
            <!-- A9a email-footer-transactional — brand mark + reason + address + © -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:28px 40px 32px;background:#fafafa;border-top:1px solid #e4e4e7">
